 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！你有好朋友吗？今天，我们来学和朋友有关的单词。"
    },
    {
     "en": "friends"
    },
    {
     "zh": "朋友。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:let",
    "focus:let"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "周末到了，妈妈说：去玩吧！让、允许，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "let"
    },
    {
     "en": "My mother lets me play."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:play",
    "edge:let>play",
    "focus:play"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "玩，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "play"
    },
    {
     "en": "Let's play!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:with",
    "edge:play>with",
    "focus:with"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "一个人玩没意思，要和别人一起玩。和……一起，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "with"
    },
    {
     "zh": "还记得第十二集的没有吗？with，加上 out，就是没有。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:friend",
    "edge:with>friend",
    "focus:friend"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "和谁一起玩呢？和好朋友！朋友，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "friend"
    },
    {
     "zh": "小提示：中间的 i 不发音哦。"
    },
    {
     "en": "I play with my friends.",
     "cue": [
      "plural:friend"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:game",
    "edge:play>game",
    "focus:game"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "我们一起玩游戏："
    },
    {
     "en": "game"
    },
    {
     "en": "Let's play a game!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:toy",
    "edge:play>toy",
    "focus:toy"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "还可以一起玩玩具："
    },
    {
     "en": "toy"
    },
    {
     "zh": "很多玩具：",
     "cue": [
      "plural:toy"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "toys"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:share",
    "edge:share>toy",
    "focus:share"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "好朋友会把自己的玩具拿出来，和大家一起玩。分享，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "share"
    },
    {
     "en": "We can share toys."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:greet",
    "edge:friend>greet",
    "focus:greet"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "见到朋友，先要打个招呼："
    },
    {
     "en": "greet"
    },
    {
     "en": "Hello, friend!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:wave",
    "edge:greet>wave",
    "focus:wave"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "离得远，就举起手来挥一挥："
    },
    {
     "en": "wave"
    },
    {
     "en": "Wave goodbye!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:shy",
    "focus:shy"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "有的小朋友见到新朋友，会脸红，不好意思说话，那是害羞："
    },
    {
     "en": "shy"
    },
    {
     "en": "Don't be shy!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:nervous",
    "edge:shy>nervous",
    "focus:nervous"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "心里怦怦跳，手心冒汗，是紧张："
    },
    {
     "en": "nervous"
    },
    {
     "zh": "别紧张，笑一笑，主动打个招呼就好啦。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:promise",
    "edge:friend>promise",
    "focus:promise"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "好朋友之间，说到就要做到。我们勾勾手指，做一个承诺："
    },
    {
     "en": "promise"
    },
    {
     "en": "I promise!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:greet,wave"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "打招呼的两种方式："
    },
    {
     "en": "greet",
     "cue": [
      "focus:greet"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "wave",
     "cue": [
      "focus:wave"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:shy,nervous"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "两种不好意思的感觉："
    },
    {
     "en": "shy",
     "cue": [
      "focus:shy"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "nervous",
     "cue": [
      "focus:nervous"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "我们来演一演，交一个新朋友吧！"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [],
   "parts": [
    {
     "en": "Hi! I'm Lele. What's your name?",
     "cue": [
      "focus:greet"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "Do you want to play with me?",
     "cue": [
